{"id": 980049, "slug": "deep-under-2", "name": "Deep Under", "name_original": "Deep Under", "description": "DEEP UNDER is a grim visual novel about how an ordinary camping trip with friends can turn into a real nightmare.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Alex is persuaded by his childhood friends to go on a small camping trip to have fun after a long separation. The character feels superfluous in the company of students, and his confusion grows when the buddies turn off the usual route and go deeper into the forest. Alex's fears are not in vain, because in the remote wilderness the carefree travelers await not wild animals or the danger of getting lost, but something much worse ...<br/><br/>You will have to go through a nightmare in the darkness of the caves, descending deeper and deeper to save your friends and unravel the tangle of mysterious events of the past of the main character.<br/>Dare to find out what evil lurks deep underground....<br/><br/><br/><br/><ul><li>A small but fascinating story that keeps you in suspense.<br/></li><li>The decisions you make affect the ending.<br/></li><li>Complex character relationships.<br/></li><li>The oppressive atmosphere of a scary fairy tale.<br/></li><li>No puzzles or riddles - just enjoy the story.</li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-04-10", "tba": false, "updated": "2024-10-28T04:14:27", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/0fa/0fa0c7a96f6c0a6668c97c92d2e77984.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/408/4087d6ce74adbafdf8b007c953e6db49.jpg", "website": "http://wildomul.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions": null, "added": 1, "added_by_status": {"beaten": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 7, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_descri